{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2LadderGate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2LadderGate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefectSubleadingD","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefectLadderE"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.canonicalLadderCandidate_passes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.canonicalLadderCandidate_passes","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L90-L94","doc":"**The ladder gate is satisfiable (non-vacuous).** The proved ladder is itself a passing\ncandidate, so the strengthened specification is consistent. The open question (G1) is whether a\n*geometric* (Seifert–CS) index realizes the whole heat-kernel ladder. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.canonicalLadderCandidate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.canonicalLadderCandidate","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L87-L88","doc":"The framework's own proved ladder, packaged as a candidate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladder_clearing_factors","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladder_clearing_factors","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L79-L85","doc":"**The clearing-factor ladder** `m_k·144^k` (`m₁=1, m₂=50, m₃=7350`): the proved structural law the\ngate's cleared coefficients follow (cf. `WLambdaDefect.denom_ladder`, `denom_E`). The recurrence of\n`144^k` is the keystone's Identity-I `144` raised to the order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladderGate_forces_vanishing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladderGate_forces_vanishing","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L67-L77","doc":"**Universal `n(n−1)` vanishing.** Any index passing the ladder gate has every derived-order\ncoefficient vanishing at `n = 0` and `n = 1` — each heat-kernel coefficient carries the `n(n−1)`\nfactor (since the partition function is exactly `Z(0) = Z(1) = 1`, no defect at the single box). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladderGate_subsumes_G2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladderGate_subsumes_G2","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L58-L65","doc":"**The full ladder subsumes the single-order G2 gate.** Passing the ladder gate ⇒ passing the\n`KeystoneG2Gate` defect gate (the `C(n)` cubic at order `h²`) — so all of G2's teeth (the n=7 sign\nflip, the cubic) apply to any ladder-passing index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladderGate_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.ladderGate_unique","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L51-L56","doc":"**Uniqueness on the derived orders.** Two indices that pass the ladder gate agree at every\nderived order — the gate leaves no free coefficient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.PassesLadderGate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.PassesLadderGate","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L46-L49","doc":"**The full-ladder gate.** A candidate passes iff its cleared coefficient matches the proved\nladder at every derived order `k ∈ {1,2,3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.HeatKernelLadderCandidate.coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.HeatKernelLadderCandidate.coeff","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The cleared coefficient at order `k` (the `m_k·144^k`-cleared `h^{2k}` coefficient). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.HeatKernelLadderCandidate.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.HeatKernelLadderCandidate.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.HeatKernelLadderCandidate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.HeatKernelLadderCandidate","kind":"structure","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L41-L44","doc":"A candidate index's full cleared heat-kernel ladder — its cleared coefficient at each order. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.canonicalLadder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneG2Gate.canonicalLadder","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneG2LadderGate.lean#L32-L39","doc":"The canonical cleared heat-kernel coefficient at order `k` (the `m_k·144^k`-cleared `h^{2k}`\ncoefficient): `k=1 → n144C`, `k=2 → n1036800D`, `k=3 → n21946982400E`; higher orders are not yet\nderived (placeholder `0`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}